+| PUT | `/projects/{pid}/members` | `{"roles":{"<userId>":"<role>",...}}` → 200 `[{"userId","role"}]` (all members) |
+
+`PUT .../members` changes several roles (`manager`/`contributor`/`viewer`) atomically: if any entry
+is invalid (unknown role, user not a member) nothing is changed (400). Only managers may call it;
+a project must keep at least one manager (409). Tasks assigned to someone demoted to `viewer`
+become unassigned.
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
